# ADR-0565 cloud-ci-no-graphql-without-adr: live-tree self-test plus RED/GREEN fixtures. The live
# leg runs the real hermetic candidate-tree collector (member Cargo.toml manifests +
# .graphql/.gql/.sdl walk) and asserts the post-drop tree is born-blocking GREEN (zero GraphQL
# artifact, EMPTY baseline); the RED fixtures prove the gate genuinely FAILS on a synthetic
# Cargo.toml adding async-graphql and on a new .graphql file with no ADR ref, and stays GREEN on an
# ADR-referenced change.
